{
  "slug": "leadfeeder",
  "name": "Leadfeeder",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Turn website visitor signals into pipeline with Leadfeeder: daily visitor briefs, visitor company research, buyer and contact discovery, personalised outreach drafts, and adding companies to your Leadfeeder lists, via the Leadfeeder connector. Requires a Leadfeeder account.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `a-getting-started` (One-time setup and readiness check for the Leadfeeder plugin — confirms the account is configured, checks that ICPs…), `add-to-pipeline` (Tag a company and/or add it to a list in Leadfeeder), `daily-visitor-brief` (Build a prioritised daily brief of website visitor companies from Leadfeeder, ranked by ICP fit and engagement signal), `find-my-buyer` (Identify the best 1–5 contacts to reach out to at a named company, ranked by Buyer Persona fit…), `outreach-companion` (Pull visit context and recent signals for a named contact or company and return structured talking points for…), `visitor-company-brief` (Produce a deep, structured company brief on a single named company from Leadfeeder — firmographics, engagement history, contacts…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `Leadfeeder`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install leadfeeder@claude-plugins-official` from `Leadfeeder/leadfeeder-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
